              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A masculine noun."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "રંદો (rando) is usually traced to Persian randa, \"a carpenter's plane\". Before થી it becomes રંદાથી."
            }
          ]
        },
